OL,3,GNEWSAVanguard patrols respond to 172
OL,4,Aincidents
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrivate security teams hired by Essex
OL,7,FCounty Council to patrol town centres
OL,8,Fhave responded to 172 incidents in the
OL,9,Ffirst month of Operation Vanguard.
OL,11,FThe Reform-led council launched the
OL,12,Fpatrols "in response to concerns,
OL,13,Fparticularly among women and girls,
OL,14,Fabout groups of male migrants being
OL,15,Fbussed from the Wethersfield asylum
OL,16,Faccommodation".
OL,18,FHowever, the data does not show if the
OL,19,Fincidents involved asylum seekers or
OL,20,Fnot - something Pam Cox, Labour MP for
OL,21,FColchester said was "deeply
OL,22,Fconcerning".
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
