OL,3,GNEWSAVanguard patrols respond to 172
OL,4,Aincidents
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said officers would not
OL,7,Fknow this information unless it was
OL,8,F"self-declared or self-evident from the
OL,9,Fcircumstances".
